  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.03 Acquiring account",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.03 “Acquiring account” means the party in an allowance transfer who obtains allowances through purchase, trade, auction, or gift.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
